  "about": {
    "title": "About the Rising Rivals set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Rising Rivals is a Platinum expansion released on 16 May 2009. It has 120 cards: 111 in the main set and 3 secret rares and 6 Rotom cards. There are also 108 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 111 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (219 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 228 cards, adding the 3 secret rares and 6 Rotom cards).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
